Python Syntax Enhanced Authors
==============================

Maintainer:

    Aaron Carlisle <https://github.com/aaronbcarlisle>

syntax/python.vim is based on Vim's built-in Python syntax file:

    Zvezdan Petkovic <zpetkovic@acm.org> (maintainer)
    Neil Schemenauer <nas@python.ca>
    Dmitry Vasiliev

Option and group names follow vim-python/python-syntax
(https://github.com/vim-python/python-syntax) for familiarity.
